Garden Choirs&nbsp;
Named after the Garden Room, in which these choirs meet, our garden choirs provide an opportunity for those who would like to perform but may prefer a slower pace and less pressure. As with the concert hoirs, performance is never mandatory, but our expectation is that members of the garden choirs will sing the second half only of the Auckland Town Hall Concert on Saturday 21 November 2026.&nbsp;

